      "Language": "ukr",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The influence of the intraperitoneal injection of quercetin solution (10 mg/kg) on painful reaction to the formalin test in male mice C57B1/6J (C57), CBA/CaLac (CBA) and in outbred albino mice was investigated. It was shown, that quercetin caused a various level of analgesia in the investigated animals. The highest level of analgesia (38,5 %) was observed in outbred white mice, the average - in mice C57 (27%) and the lowest - in mice CBA (13%)."},
